# The context of the build carries what the image needs and nothing else.
#
# Without this file, the whole working tree is sent to the daemon of the
# build: the dependencies of the development (217 MB), the history of the
# repository and the documents. The image copies `src`, `package.json`
# and `bun.lock`, and nothing else.

.git
.github
node_modules
dist
coverage
.hub
*.log

# The secrets of a development machine never enter a build.
.env
.env.*

# The tests, the scripts and the documents are not part of the image.
test
scripts
docs
*.md
LICENSE
